---
/**
 * Counter enquiries: native <details>/<summary>, so it works without JS and with a keyboard.
 */
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
import { limits, fmt, site } from '../../config/site';

interface Props {
  sponsorUrl: string;
}
const { sponsorUrl } = Astro.props;

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Right, what’s the catch?',
    a: [
      `Honestly, the fair-use limits above: ${fmt.n(limits.emailsPerDay)} instant emails a day through our sender (the rest arrive in a daily digest), up to ${fmt.n(limits.forms)} forms and ${fmt.n(limits.submissionsPerFormPerMonth)} submissions a month per form. That’s it. There’s no paid plan we’re nudging you towards, no branding you pay to remove, and no feature held back for later.`,
      'The only thing we ask is that you don’t use it for spam or phishing. We hold forms that ask for passwords or card numbers, and we shut down abuse.',
    ],
  },
  {
    q: 'So how do you pay for it?',
    a: [
      'sendm8 is built to run on Cloudflare’s free plan and free email allowances, which is exactly why the limits exist. The real costs are a domain name and our time.',
      'If it ever outgrows the free plans, Cloudflare’s next step up is a few dollars a month. Donations and sponsors cover that. There are no ads, investors or data deals behind it.',
    ],
  },
  {
    q: 'Will you start charging later?',
    a: [
      'We have no plans to. We won’t pretend nothing can ever change, though: if the free allowances we rely on shrink, the hosted limits might have to shrink with them, and we’d tell you well in advance.',
      `What can’t change is the code. It’s open source under ${site.license}, so you can self-host your own copy, free, for as long as you like.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    q: 'What if sendm8 disappears?',
    a: [
      'Your submissions export as CSV or JSON whenever you like, and there’s no fee to take them with you.',
      'Your forms don’t need us either. Deploy sendm8 to your own Cloudflare account, change the URL in your form’s action, and carry on. Our field names match Formspree’s, so moving somewhere else entirely is a one-line change too.',
    ],
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you sell my data, or my visitors’ data?',
    a: [
      'No. Not to advertisers, not to “partners”, not to anyone. Submissions are stored so you can read them, delivered where you’ve asked, and that’s all they’re used for.',
      `Spam submissions are deleted automatically after ${limits.spamRetentionDays} days. When you delete a form or a submission, it’s gone.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I need an account?',
    a: [
      'No. Put your email address in the form’s action URL, confirm the one email we send you, and submissions start arriving. No password, no signup form.',
      'Sign in with GitHub or Google when you want the extras: the dashboard inbox, Discord, Slack, Telegram and webhooks, allowed domains and your own Resend key.',
    ],
    link: { href: '/docs#zero-signup', label: 'How zero-signup forms work' },
  },
  {
    q: 'What about GDPR, and where is the data kept?',
    a: [
      'sendm8 runs on Cloudflare: the code on Workers, submissions in a D1 database and uploaded files in R2 storage. Email goes out through Resend, or through your own Resend account if you add a key.',
      'We never store a visitor’s raw IP address. Rate limits and blocklists use a one-way hash of it instead. You’re the one collecting the data, so mention sendm8 in your privacy notice as the service that receives your form submissions.',
      'If you need the data to stay in a particular place, self-hosting lets you choose your own Cloudflare account and settings.',
    ],
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I sponsor it?',
    a: [
      'Yes please, and thank you. Sponsorship pays for the running costs and gives us time to work on it. You don’t get more limits for it: the plan is the same for everyone, sponsor or not.',
      'Can’t spare money? Reporting bugs, fixing docs and telling a mate about it helps just as much.',
    ],
    link: { href: sponsorUrl, label: 'Sponsor sendm8 on GitHub', external: true },
  },
];
---

<section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="bay label label-lg"><span class="bay-no">05</span> Enquiries</p>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-side">
        <h2 id="faq-title" class="h1">Fair questions.</h2>
        <p class="faq-lede">
          The things people ask about anything that says “free”. If yours isn’t here, email <a href={`mailto:${site.helloEmail}`}>{site.helloEmail}</a> and
          a person will answer.
        </p>
        <p class="faq-window label muted" aria-hidden="true">Window 3 · Enquiries · Please take a ticket</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list">
        {
          faqs.map((f, i) => (
            <details class="slip" open={i === 0}>
              <summary>
                <span class="slip-no mono">Q{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <span class="slip-q">{f.q}</span>
                <span class="slip-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                  <Icon name="plus" size={20} strokeWidth={2} />
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="slip-a">
                {f.a.map((p) => (
                  <p>{p}</p>
                ))}
                {f.link && (
                  <p>
                    <a
                      class="link-signal slip-link"
                      href={f.link.href}
                      {...('external' in f.link && f.link.external ? { rel: 'noopener', target: '_blank' } : {})}
                    >
                      {f.link.label}
                      <Icon name={'external' in f.link && f.link.external ? 'arrow-up-right' : 'arrow-right'} size={15} strokeWidth={2} />
                    </a>
                  </p>
                )}
              </div>
            </details>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    margin-top: var(--s-7);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .faq-side {
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
  }
  .faq-lede {
    margin-top: var(--s-5);
    max-width: 36ch;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .faq-lede a {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .faq-window {
    margin-top: var(--s-6);
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line);
  }
  .faq-list {
    border-top: var(--bw-heavy) solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .slip {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .slip summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.25rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    padding-block: 1.15rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .slip summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .slip summary:hover .slip-q {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
  }
  .slip summary:focus-visible {
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .slip-no {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--signal-text);
  }
  .slip-q {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-stretch: var(--stretch-semi);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  .slip-toggle {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transition:
      transform var(--dur-2) var(--ease-thunk),
      background-color var(--dur-1);
  }
  .slip[open] .slip-toggle {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: var(--fg);
    color: var(--bg);
  }
  .slip-a {
    padding: 0 3rem 1.5rem 3.25rem;
    padding-left: calc(3.25rem + var(--s-3));
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    max-width: calc(64ch + 6rem);
  }
  .slip-a p {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .slip-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .faq-side {
      position: static;
    }
    .faq-window {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .slip summary {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    }
    .slip-no {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      margin-bottom: -0.5rem;
    }
    .slip-a {
      padding: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
